(1312, 16, 'f_about_except_text', 'Our expansion into the realm of commercial real estate services, is tailored to match the specific investment goals of our clients. With the strength of the Sotheby\'s International Realty®network, we connect you to premier investors buyers, sellers, and tenants.\r\n\r\nWith Gibson Associates, you have a guide with unrivaled local expertise and extensive global reach to help you navigate the market and achieve unparalleled financial success.'),
